# Honcho summary model — as served for the 2026-09-13 smoke (`ollama create summary-smoke -f Modelfile`).
# FROM points at the GGUF from `train_lora.py --stage export`. No TEMPLATE line on purpose: Ollama uses
# its built-in qwen3.5 renderer; the model closes the think block itself (served-prompt encoding in
# train_lora.encode_example). Temperature 0.1: Phase 0 showed 0.1 slightly better than 0.7 for the base,
# the training targets are deterministic summaries, and the dialectic model serves at 0.1 too.
# num_ctx: a long-summary prompt is ~6k tokens (60 messages + an ~800-word previous summary); 16384 is
# ample and keeps the KV cache small — 65536 works but reserves VRAM for nothing.
FROM runs/v1-gguf_gguf/merged.Q4_K_M.gguf
PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
